entries[370965] = { ["name"] = "The Hunt", ["text"] = "50 yd range\n1 sec cast 1.5 min cooldown\nHavoc\nCharge to your target, striking them for (604.1% of Attack Power) Chaos damage, rooting them in place for 1.5 sec and inflicting (390% of Attack Power) Chaos damage over 6 sec to up to 5 enemies in your path.\n\nThe pursuit invigorates your soul, healing you for 10% of the damage you deal to your Hunt target for 20 sec.\n\nVengeance\nCharge to your target, striking them for (604.1% of Attack Power) Chaos damage, rooting them in place for 1.5 sec and inflicting (390% of Attack Power) Chaos damage over 6 sec to up to 5 enemies in your path.\n\nThe pursuit invigorates your soul, healing you for 25% of the damage you deal to your Hunt target for 20 sec." }
